{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://stock.local/schemas/us_short_batch5_status_source_access_packet/1.0.0/schema.json",
  "title": "US-short Batch5 Status-Source Access Packet",
  "description": "Machine-checkable US-short batch5 status-source ACCESS packet (Cut 1, slice 1a). It records the offline, reviewed authorization boundary for a later separately-confirmed small-sample status-source SHAPE probe (delisted/otc via a ticker reference, halted via a public exchange halt feed). It resolves the frozen status-source binding's `status_source_access_packet_approval` decision gate; it executes NO status-source call, reads no raw payloads, does not scan bankruptcy 8-Ks per issuer, does not fetch the full market, does not rewire the universe runner or the candidate-artifact schema, and authorizes no DataHub / production / ship-gate use. The exact per-source endpoints are confirmed at preflight, not by this packet.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_name",
    "schema_version",
    "generated_at",
    "source_artifact_refs",
    "scope",
    "status_source_probe_boundary",
    "deferred_scope",
    "storage_and_secret_boundary",
    "preflight_gates",
    "prohibited_claims",
    "next_steps",
    "limitations"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_name": {"const": "us_short_batch5_status_source_access_packet"},
    "schema_version": {"const": "1.0.0"},
    "generated_at": {"const": "2026-06-30T00:00:00+08:00"},
    "source_artifact_refs": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/sourceArtifactRef"},
      "minItems": 4,
      "maxItems": 4,
      "allOf": [
        {"contains": {"type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id", "path", "role"],
          "properties": {"artifact_id": {"const": "us_short_status_source_binding"},
            "path": {"const": "docs/us_short_batch5_status_source_binding_20260629.json"},
            "role": {"const": "Frozen per-flag status-source contract (delisted/otc -> ticker_reference, halted -> exchange_halt_feed, bankruptcy -> sec_8k_item_103 best-effort); this access packet resolves its status_source_access_packet_approval decision gate for the small-sample shape probe only."}}}},
        {"contains": {"type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id", "path", "role"],
          "properties": {"artifact_id": {"const": "us_short_system_design"},
            "path": {"const": "docs/us_short_system_design.md"},
            "role": {"const": "Single design authority; §3.3 critical-status unknown must not be assumed clean, §3.7 provider health, §18.0 P0 provider authorization gate (SR-PROVIDER-001)."}}}},
        {"contains": {"type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id", "path", "role"],
          "properties": {"artifact_id": {"const": "sr_provider_001"},
            "path": {"const": "docs/system_risk_register.md"},
            "role": {"const": "Open provider blocker; this packet authorizes NO live status call — it records the reviewed boundary for a later user-confirmed + preflighted small-sample shape probe."}}}},
        {"contains": {"type": "object", "required": ["artifact_id", "path", "role"],
          "properties": {"artifact_id": {"const": "us_short_universe_fetch_runner"},
            "path": {"const": "runners/us_short_universe_fetch.py"},
            "role": {"const": "Round-1 Pass1 that currently hardwires delisted/halted/bankruptcy/otc to False behind an honest disclosure; the parser-into-apply_pass1 rewire that consumes the sourced status is deferred to 1b with the live fetch."}}}}
      ]
    },
    "scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"},
    "status_source_probe_boundary": {"$ref": "#/$defs/statusSourceProbeBoundary"},
    "deferred_scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/deferredScope"},
    "storage_and_secret_boundary": {"$ref": "#/$defs/storageAndSecretBoundary"},
    "preflight_gates": {"$ref": "#/$defs/preflightGates"},
    "prohibited_claims": {"$ref": "#/$defs/prohibitedClaims"},
    "next_steps": {"const": [
      "Review this offline status-source access packet before any live call.",
      "On the user's post-review confirmation, run a preflight that confirms the exact ticker_reference + halt-feed endpoints, the gitignored raw path scope, the no-secret summary contract, and the 2-call zero-retry budget — no status call before that.",
      "After preflight + the user's execute, run the bounded shape probe (2 bulk calls) and validate the response shapes on AAPL / MSFT / JPM only.",
      "Whole-market application of the two bulk feeds, the per-issuer bankruptcy 8-K scan, the apply_pass1 rewire, and the candidate-artifact status-provenance schema are separate later steps (1b / separate packets)."
    ]},
    "limitations": {"const": [
      "This artifact performs no status-source calls, reads no raw payloads, scans no bankruptcy 8-Ks, fetches no full market, and rewires no runner or schema.",
      "It authorizes ONLY a future user-confirmed + preflighted small-sample SHAPE probe of the ticker reference and the halt feed (delisted/otc/halted); the exact endpoints are confirmed at preflight, not here.",
      "bankruptcy is positive-detection-only and best-effort (binding mark_unscreened_not_clean); the per-issuer 8-K scan is deferred to a separate budgeted packet, and an unscreened bankruptcy universe is disclosed, never asserted clean.",
      "It does not resolve SR-PROVIDER-001; the live fetch, parser-into-runner integration, candidate-artifact status-provenance schema, full-market application, DataHub/runner consumption, production storage, live_normalized evidence, and ship-gate claims remain gated pending separate reviewed steps."
    ]}
  },
